  m_text: "Lower Body Plan : \n\n3 Sets Deadlift \n\n*Popper Deadlift technique :\n\nStand
    with feet hip-width apart, bar over mid-foot.\r\nBend at hips and knees, grip
    bar just outside knees.\r\nExhale, straighten hips and knees, lift bar close
    to body.\r\nStand tall, shoulders back, hips fully extended.\n\n"
