  m_text: "Upper body Workout Plan :\n\n2 Sets Chest press\n\n1 Set Sit Ups\n\n*Propper
    Chest press technique :\nLie flat, feet on the floor, grip bar slightly wider
    than shoulders.\r\nLift bar above chest, arms extended.\r\nInhale, lower bar
    to mid-chest, elbows at 45\xB0.\r\nExhale, push bar back up, keeping control.\n\n*Propper
    Sit-Ups technique : \nLie on your back, knees bent, feet flat on the floor.\r\nPlace
    hands behind your head\r\nExhale, lift your upper body towards your knees using
    your core.\r\nInhale, slowly lower back down to the starting position\n"
